combat, Lycaon is an Ice-attribute attacker, primarily using his mechanical legs which produce streams of super-cooled air. Physically, he isn’t afraid to use his legs, hands, or even his teeth if necessary.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lycaon is rational and reliable – an elegant gentleman most of the time, and versatile enough to be able to assist with almost anything. He’s slightly obsessed with cleanliness, about as one would expect from a butler.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Although he is normally a very elegant and composed individual, occasionally his canine instincts shine through. When he’s happy, his tail and ears unconsciously wag – he’s aware of this and slightly bothered by it. Like most furry Thiren, Lycaon takes great care of his fur.</othernotes>
